# BUG (QA M0): holding JUMP through the death and respawn makes the player
# jump in the first step after the respawn without a new press.
# Steps: fall into the 3-wide gap (Died at 235), press and hold JUMP from step
# 236 (during Dying) with RIGHT+RUN; respawn at 295.
# Expected: a jump needs a new press (Player::update edge-detects JUMP), so the
# player just runs along the ground: x~76.9 at step 325 (same as without JUMP).
# Actual: Jumped at step 296 (Player::spawn resets jump_held to false, so the
# held button counts as a fresh press); in the air the player accelerates
# with air_accel and is at x=64 at step 325.
level  = testbed
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=235..235 deaths=1 state=playing player_x>=76
---
RB 110
RBJ 35
RB 90     # runs off into the 3-wide gap, Died at 235
RBJ 90    # JUMP pressed during Dying and held through the respawn (295)
